# Bristlebud Farmer: after the mill, "you may put a permanent card from among them into your hand" is optional too (CR 701.17): Bot1 sacrifices a Food, mills three cards
# (Lightning Bolt, Memnite, Forest) and takes none, so all three stay in the graveyard with the Lotus and the hand is unchanged.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Bristlebud Farmer
Forest
Mox Emerald
Plains x3
Plains
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Forest
Plains x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bristlebud Farmer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bristlebud Farmer > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Food Token)
Bot1.Choose()

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot1.Library.Count = 9
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
